{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28120","headline":"寄永乐殷尧藩明府 · 雍陶","name":"寄永乐殷尧藩明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古县萧条秋景晚，昔年陶令亦如君。\n头巾漉酒临黄菊，手[板]支颐向白云。\n百里岂能容骥足，九霄终自别鸡羣。\n相思不恨书来少，佳句多从阙下闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"雍陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28120.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28120","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}